WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
The Showdown Between Geniuses!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.550
Tohma VS Nanami

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:07.880
The Showdown Between Geniuses!

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.550
Tohma VS Nanami!

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.020
Masaru and the others headed for the Holy Capital.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:18.210
It turned out to be a moving city that rested on top of a massive ElDoradimon.

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.520
Its residents, Baromon and the others, were hostile to the humans.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:26.590
But once they realized that Masaru is the son of Daimon Suguru, who saved ElDoradimon ten years ago,

00:00:26.590 --> 00:00:29.150
they became more than willing to fight together with them.

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:34.070
Masaru decided to uphold his father's will and swore to protect the Holy Capital.

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:43.650
From our vantage point here,

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:46.960
we can immediately spot all enemies who approach ElDoradimon.

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:50.960
The Gizmon's gunfire can't reach us from the opposite shore either,

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:55.290
so we'll be able to concentrate our attack on those who approach us.

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:55.920
Yes.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.380
You chose a good place.

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.190
It truly is impenetrable.

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:02.600
Dad protected this place,

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:04.180
so I'll do all I can to do the same!

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:07.200
That's our savior's son!

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.190
I'm entrusting our friend to you.

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:12.870
You've got a lot of responsibility on your hands, Aniki.

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:13.860
Yeah.

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:17.960
It was Master who came up with the strategy!

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:19.320
A savior...

00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:38.640
That's the best strategy that can be made out of their current condition.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:41.300
It appears they have a smart officer within their ranks.

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:44.340
It must be Tohma-kun's idea.

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:45.640
Tohma?

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:51.610
By merely judging from his I.Q., you can tell that Tohma-kun's intelligence is beyond that of an ordinary person's.

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:56.040
He is most commonly categorized as a genius.

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:56.860
Yes...

00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:59.320
Just like you.

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:02.700
That sounds interesting.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:06.790
It doesn't matter what they come up with.

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:09.240
I'll crush them with my own hands!

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:15.800
Garbage...

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:18.640
must be properly disposed of.

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:20.120
Those are the rules.

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:23.790
If you liken those guys to garbage, then I just made a good pun.

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:26.380
But you'll never hear that coming from me.

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:29.020
You're saying everything you're thinking out loud again.

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:32.260
Anyway, there's no need to rush.

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:37.050
Don't you think it's boring to simply win?

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:42.280
Since they took the trouble to defend themselves, let's play with them for a bit first.

00:02:47.350 --> 00:02:49.700
You found where the Gizmon are assembling?

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:50.370
Yes.

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:52.450
The enemy's base is here.

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:53.580
On top of Akatsuki Hill.

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:56.250
I saw humans there, too.

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:57.670
This man is their leader.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:59.340
This is...!

00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:59.340
This is...!

00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:05.140
The savior's face is marked with sweat!

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:07.530
Is the enemy that formidable?!

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:12.680
Igamon, was this man wearing a white robe and glasses?

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:13.220
Yes.

00:03:13.220 --> 00:03:13.810
He was.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.220
It's Kurata!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.220
It's Kurata!

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:19.990
Everyone!

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:23.010
As of now, we have an announcement from our savior.

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.910
Quiet down and listen closely!

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:27.410
Aniki, you're up!

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:31.000
Don't slip up, savior.

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:33.630
We know where the enemy is located!

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:35.920
Now we'll march right in and bring Kurata down!

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:39.000
What?

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.120
We're making the first move?

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:41.170
We'll go, too!

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:42.890
Ikuto!

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:46.030
We've had enough of Digimon getting hurt!

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:48.890
Also for Mercurimon and Yukidarumon...

00:03:49.240 --> 00:03:51.770
We'll end this fight quickly!

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:54.190
We'll join you!

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:57.900
We'll beat Kurata and bring peace back to the Digital World!

00:03:58.410 --> 00:03:59.250
All right!

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.400
Let's settle this in one shot!

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:01.860
Wait!

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:03.820
This is a trap!

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:06.950
A trap?

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:11.610
We were able to find their location so easily.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:13.860
It's not like Kurata to be this careless.

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:15.700
He must be intentionally using his camp as bait,

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:18.500
in order to force us to divide up our troops.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:22.300
We should stay here for now and wait for the enemy to come to us.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:23.570
That's...

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:25.680
You're thinking too much into it...

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:27.950
I don't care if it's a trap!

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.220
As long as Kurata's defeated, the fight will end!

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:33.180
Then you're just doing what Kurata wants!

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:35.480
He's waiting for us to make our move!

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:37.900
Then we'll just go ourselves!

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:39.760
You don't have a problem with that, right?

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:42.940
Even if there were two of Kurata around, we'd be more than enough for him.

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.400
This isn't one of your little school fights!

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:47.150
If we don't follow a strategy,

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:49.210
we can't protect the Holy Capital!

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:51.500
A good offense is the best defense!

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:53.450
I'm gonna kick Kurata's ass and that's that!

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.930
Words of a true hero!

00:04:57.930 --> 00:04:59.340
We're counting on you!

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:03.710
Why doesn't anyone understand?

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:06.850
Well...

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:10.150
It might be best to just go with the flow.

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:11.140
No way...

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:13.510
Even Yushima-san agrees with them...

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.940
I'll definitely have beaten Kurata the next time you see me.

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:23.150
So take care of defending this place for me until then, Tohma!

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:25.940
You don't need to tell me that.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:28.610
Well, see ya!

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:31.290
Set off!

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:37.890
Hey, don't leave me behind!

00:05:37.890 --> 00:05:39.960
Aniki, hurry up!

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.370
Wait up, you bastard!

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:45.480
I can't believe that reckless guy is considered a savior.

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:47.380
I fear for the future.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:49.590
You think so?

00:05:49.590 --> 00:05:52.220
I think the reason why Masaru continues to take such risks...

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:54.680
is because he trusts you, Tohma.

00:07:02.300 --> 00:07:03.380
Kurata!

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:04.670
Prepare to die!

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:06.500
We'll end everything here!

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:07.810
Both this fight...

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:09.460
and the chaos in the Digital World!

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:15.690
Master, here they come.

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:16.140
Yeah.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.040
Not to worry.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.480
Things will be fine if we go according to plan.

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:36.610
They all missed!

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:37.330
We suck!

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:41.680
Iga-Ryuu Shuriken Nage!

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:41.680
Iga-Style Shuriken Throw

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:46.380
Oh no!

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:48.670
One of them made it through!

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:53.680
Meteor Dance!

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:01.460
We beat them.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:02.390
No.

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:04.810
They've just come to get a feel of our strength.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:08.440
The next place they'll attack will be over there.

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:12.400
Thank goodness.

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:14.070
It appears...

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:16.280
Nothing's happened to it yet, hmm?

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:17.320
Who's there?!

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.270
Dear, dear.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:25.040
Have you already forgotten my voice?

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:33.570
Nanami?

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:34.220
Impossible!

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:41.140
If this waterfall is destroyed, the water from the lake it's coming from will gush forth in one huge blast.

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:44.850
When that happens, ElDoradimon will be left completely defenseless.

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:47.710
Yes.

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:51.610
This waterfall is the Achilles' heel in your strategy.

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:54.860
And so, you will come here to protect it.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:00.590
You were able to predict everything?

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:03.200
Anyone could see it, if they just gave it some thought.

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:05.060
Wouldn't you agree,

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.960
Doctor Tohma Norstein?

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:11.980
It appears that you're something of a genius.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:14.700
I'm quite interested in you.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.630
I wonder for how long...

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:19.930
you will entertain me!

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:32.380
Master!

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:33.210
I'm okay!

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:43.370
They were waiting to ambush us!

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:46.320
I told you, it doesn't matter if it's a trap.

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:47.580
Aniki...

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.900
Come on.

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:50.210
I'll take all of you on...

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:51.640
and punch your lights out!

00:09:52.760 --> 00:09:54.100
Double Backhand!

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:57.510
You...!

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.020
I've got you!

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:09.390
She's reading Gaomon's movements!

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:12.910
It's not that difficult.

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:16.110
When you're as smart as I am, you already know what he's about to do.

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:20.110
Nothing that moves within your hearts is left unseen to me.

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:21.870
Absolutely nothing.

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:25.110
But...

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:28.040
There is one thing I don't understand.

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:30.330
Why...

00:10:31.140 --> 00:10:32.750
Why are you fighting?

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:33.920
What?

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.380
The Digimon's existence won't bring you any worth.

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:40.680
There's no reason for a genius like you to fight them.

00:10:41.020 --> 00:10:42.990
Digimon are our friends!

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.890
They can connect emotionally with us humans!

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:47.940
Yes, Master!

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:49.650
Making those friends...

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:52.730
Those comrades of ours suffer is what I can't allow Kurata to get away with!

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:01.030
How absurd.

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:03.470
Did you think you could fool me with that "defender of justice" talk?

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:04.610
What?

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:08.990
You just feel a sense of superiority from helping those who are weaker than you.

00:11:08.990 --> 00:11:10.460
Even when you're executing DATS's missions,

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:13.250
the honest truth is that you're only doing them for your own conceited, self-satisfaction!

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:16.000
Don't make fun of Master!

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.620
What a boring attack.

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:24.120
Glorious Burst!

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:29.530
Great, that's gotta be all of them!

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:29.930
Wait!

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.430
There's more!

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:36.570
Just the way I like it!

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:38.090
Let's go, ShineGreymon!

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:39.030
Yeah!

00:11:40.980 --> 00:11:41.490
Damn it!

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:43.490
Gaomon, don't chase her too far!

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:46.340
Tohma...

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:49.240
I understand your loneliness.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:53.870
The thirst in your heart that nothing you do can satisfy.

00:11:54.930 --> 00:11:56.540
What would you know?!

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:57.790
I know.

00:11:57.790 --> 00:11:59.550
After all, both you and I...

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.850
are of the same race.

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:06.470
You can't help but feel lonely, can you?

00:12:06.470 --> 00:12:10.850
After all, everyone else around you are idiots.

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:14.610
There isn't one person out there who understands you.

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:18.310
Being a genius means being alone.

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:23.070
In that case, let me ask you this.

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:25.120
Why are you supporting Kurata?

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:31.490
Why do you side with a fool who fears Digimon and wants to eradicate them?!

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:37.310
I don't remember siding with him.

00:12:37.310 --> 00:12:40.550
Hunting for Digimon is just another way of passing the time.

00:12:41.170 --> 00:12:42.750
What?!

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:43.900
Like I said,

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:48.140
when you become a genius like me, everything bores you.

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:51.220
But now I've found something much more interesting.

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:55.520
Will you join me, Tohma Norstein?

00:12:56.610 --> 00:12:58.440
What are you saying?

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:01.390
Only a genius can understand a fellow genius.

00:13:01.390 --> 00:13:03.200
If you join me,

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:06.910
changing this world to whatever we please isn't a mere dream.

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:30.070
A self-destructive attack?

00:13:30.070 --> 00:13:30.890
Master!

00:13:30.890 --> 00:13:32.760
We should hurry back!

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:35.520
That's not the place for you to return to.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.570
Now, come with me.

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:41.630
Let's build a more exciting world.

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:46.510
I refuse.

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:49.570
I have a duty to protect the Holy Capital.

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:52.350
Even though you're a genius...

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:54.290
you're a stubborn blockhead...

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:58.990
Then, I'll just have to make you understand through force.

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:00.970
We've defeated you once.

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:02.250
You can't win against us now.

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:06.050
Evolution isn't your special privilege.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:13.910
Hyper Bio...

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:15.920
Extra Evolution!

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:21.940
BioLotusmon!

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:31.910
BioLotusmon

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:31.910
Ultimate Level

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:23.870
BioLotusmon.

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:27.030
A Bio Hybrid type formed from the fusion of a human and a Digimon.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:29.170
Her special attack is Seventh Fantasia.

00:14:29.170 --> 00:14:31.910
Its rainbow-colored aura compels you to lose your will to fight.

00:14:33.440 --> 00:14:34.870
Let me show you...

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:38.370
My new power that is beyond the Ultimate Level!

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:40.650
Beyond the Ultimate Level?

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:41.900
Let's go, Gaomon!

00:14:45.260 --> 00:14:47.330
Digisoul Charge!

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:48.840
Overdrive!

00:14:49.170 --> 00:14:50.470
Gaomon, evolve!

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:10.450
MirageGaogamon!

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:15.820
We don't know what her abilities are.

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:16.790
Be careful.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:17.700
Yes, Master.

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:18.980
Here I come!

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:26.040
She's fast!

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:28.550
I can read all of your movements!

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.570
Seventh Fantasia!

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:41.580
MirageGaogamon!

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:46.970
Tohma.

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:48.450
Come with me.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:51.560
I've had enough of boredom.

00:15:56.070 --> 00:16:00.110
I will be different from those fools around you who don't appreciate you.

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:03.290
Come create a new world with me.

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:04.250
Come on!

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:08.710
I will be able to understand you.

00:16:09.090 --> 00:16:10.790
You can control the new world...

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:13.790
No, maybe even the universe!

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:16.660
I...

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:19.000
I am not that self-conceited!

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:22.930
There's a source of power in this world that even I can't calculate!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.040
Daimon Masaru, is it?

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.150
That's right.

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:29.080
There are times when I've been saved by his abilities.

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:31.820
So you rely on something like him.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:33.410
Rely on him?

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:34.680
Me?

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:37.000
There's no such thing as something beyond calculation.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:38.030
That's just an excuse.

00:16:38.570 --> 00:16:41.480
If you continue to stay content living with fools,

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:44.650
you'll only neglect improving yourself!

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:45.750
That's not...

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:49.710
Throw away your worthless friends and your insignificant self-satisfaction!

00:16:50.550 --> 00:16:54.420
Both you and I will become the gods of the new world!

00:16:54.670 --> 00:16:55.460
Tohma...

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:56.330
Tohma...

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:57.280
Tohma...

00:16:57.390 --> 00:16:58.130
Tohma...

00:16:58.360 --> 00:16:58.940
Tohma...

00:16:59.040 --> 00:16:59.870
Tohma...

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:01.600
Let go of Master!

00:17:05.860 --> 00:17:06.840
Master.

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:08.580
Are you all right?

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:09.060
Yeah...

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.550
Mikafutsu-no-kami!

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:17.030
All right, that's gotta be all of 'em this time!

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:17.570
Wait!

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:23.050
They come again!

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:25.900
What's more, they keep showing up the same way like all the others!

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:26.940
Bring it on.

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.700
Let's go, ShineGreymon!

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:29.330
Yeah!

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:33.400
Master, she can predict all of my movements.

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.210
Please guide me through your orders.

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:36.150
All right.

00:17:36.150 --> 00:17:36.850
Let's go!

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:38.130
Yes, Master!

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:42.970
Attack Pattern!

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:44.520
Gamma Formation 0.25!

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:45.640
Yes!

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:47.750
Double Crescent...!

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:53.770
This is a strategy from a genius?

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:55.610
I can figure it out easily.

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:58.330
Master, your orders!

00:17:58.330 --> 00:17:59.230
Okay!

00:17:59.230 --> 00:18:00.910
Pattern Omega Option B!

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:02.700
Yes, Master!

00:18:10.780 --> 00:18:11.960
Gale Claw!

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:15.300
Now that's more like it!

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:19.860
But you won't lay a scratch on me at this level.

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:24.810
Now, entertain me some more!

00:18:25.190 --> 00:18:27.120
Master, your orders!

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:27.520
Okay!

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:30.390
Your orders...

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:34.270
Master, your orders!

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:36.780
Master!

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:42.070
We can't even deal her a single blow...

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:45.280
My strategies aren't working?

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:48.470
I've enjoyed myself, but this is as far as it goes.

00:18:48.470 --> 00:18:49.460
Enough is enough.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.150
If you join me,

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:55.250
I'll leave the waterfall alone.

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:58.480
She's predicting all of my calculations.

00:18:58.480 --> 00:19:00.350
What the hell should I...?

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:03.320
It's not...

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:04.680
It's not over yet!

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:09.710
Master, it's too dangerous.

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:11.500
Just do it.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:12.230
Yes.

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:14.590
What are you doing on his shoulder?

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:15.980
Whatever you do is useless!

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:22.060
Serpent Ruin!

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:24.010
Don't dodge it!

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:28.410
Master!

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:29.410
Don't worry about me.

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:30.870
GO!

00:19:33.680 --> 00:19:34.570
No way!

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:36.940
Don't be reckless!

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:37.630
Do you want to die?!

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:40.050
Now!

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:44.690
Full Moon Blaster!

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:53.980
You plunged in while receiving my attack head-on...

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:56.570
Just what sort of calculations did you use?!

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:57.940
None.

00:19:57.940 --> 00:20:02.400
I just thought that if we got close enough to attack at point-blank range, then we'd be able to pull it off.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:08.460
I lost... to such a foolish attack...

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:19.340
Oh, crap!

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:29.000
These tremors...

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:29.930
It can't be!

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:31.760
Professor Kurata.

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:33.840
BioLotusmon's signal has disappeared.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:36.440
Oh, did she lose?

00:20:36.680 --> 00:20:40.410
Well, since the waterfall is destroyed, that's good enough.

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:44.340
Daimon Masaru and Ikuto are still engaged with the Gizmon:XT.

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:48.820
If this keeps up, you may not get your turn.

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:02.170
I...

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:04.990
I haven't lost to you...

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:07.840
Because...

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:09.690
What you used was...

00:21:09.690 --> 00:21:12.890
Daimon Masaru's power...

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.140
Masaru's...

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:23.360
power?

00:21:25.670 --> 00:21:27.010
Master...

00:21:31.910 --> 00:21:34.700
Why... do I feel so irritated?

